            "selectCount": 2,
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 11 and 12</h3><p>Choose <strong>TWO</strong> letters, <strong>A–E</strong>.</p><p>According to Megan, what are the <strong>TWO</strong> main advantages of working in the agriculture and horticulture sectors?</p>",
