                "textHtml": "Which <strong>TWO</strong> points does Adam make about his experiment on artificial sweeteners?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "The results were what he had predicted."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "The experiment was simple to set up."
