          {
            "id": "part-3-group-2",
            "type": "mcq",
            "selectCount": 2,
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 23 and 24</h3><p>Choose <strong>TWO</strong> letters, <strong>A–E</strong>.</p><p>Which <strong>TWO</strong> problems did Rosie have when measuring the fat content of nuts?</p>",
